<ul>
<li><b>The manual's chapters are numbered coherently.</b> Every section now reads the same way — an unnumbered introduction, then chapters 1–N in reading order. The Expert Manual's stray "10 — Web Review" and mid-list "Appendix" are gone: shortcuts are chapter 9, Web Review is chapter 10.</li>
<li><b>The sidebar sets chapter numbers in an aligned gutter</b>, so each section reads as a numbered list instead of ragged title prefixes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
